---
const title = 'Terms of Use – WeFitNest';
const description = 'Terms of Use for WeFitNest — a fitness and nutrition logging app for iOS and Android.';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="/favicon.ico" />
    <title>{title}</title>
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta property="og:title" content={title} />
    <meta property="og:description" content={description} />
    <meta property="og:site_name" content="WeFitNest" />
    <style>
      *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

      body {
        font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
        background: #f9f9f9;
        color: #1a1a1a;
        line-height: 1.7;
      }

      header {
        background: #ffffff;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #e8e8e8;
        padding: 18px 24px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
      }

      header .logo {
        font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
        font-size: 1.2rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.14em;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2196f3 0%, #00bcd4 60%, #14cba8 100%);
        -webkit-background-clip: text;
        -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        background-clip: text;
      }

      header .logo span {
        color: #1a1a1a;
      }

      .container {
        max-width: 760px;
        margin: 48px auto;
        padding: 0 24px 64px;
      }

      .page-title {
        font-size: 2rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        color: #1a1a1a;
        margin-bottom: 6px;
      }

      .updated {
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        color: #777;
        margin-bottom: 32px;
      }

      .intro {
        background: #f0effe;
        border-left: 4px solid #4f46e5;
        border-radius: 6px;
        padding: 16px 20px;
        margin-bottom: 36px;
      }

      .intro p {
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        color: #3730a3;
      }

      h2 {
        font-size: 1.15rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #4f46e5;
        margin-top: 40px;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
        padding-bottom: 6px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0ff;
      }

      p {
        font-size: 0.93rem;
        color: #333;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
      }

      ul {
        padding-left: 22px;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
      }

      ul li {
        font-size: 0.93rem;
        color: #333;
        margin-bottom: 6px;
      }

      strong {
        color: #1a1a1a;
      }

      .contact-email {
        display: inline-block;
        margin-top: 6px;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #4f46e5;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
      }

      .contact-email:hover {
        text-decoration: underline;
      }

      .policy-link {
        color: #4f46e5;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .policy-link:hover {
        text-decoration: underline;
      }

      footer {
        text-align: center;
        padding: 24px;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        color: #aaa;
        border-top: 1px solid #e8e8e8;
        margin-top: 48px;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>

    <header>
      <a class="logo" href="/">WeFitNest</a>
    </header>

    <div class="container">

      <h1 class="page-title">Terms of Use</h1>
      <p class="updated">Last updated: May 29, 2026</p>

      <div class="intro">
        <p>
          By downloading or using WeFitNest, you agree to these Terms of Use.
          If you do not agree, please do not use the App.
        </p>
      </div>

      <p>
        Welcome to WeFitNest ("the App", "we", "our", or "us"). These Terms of Use govern your access to and use of the App,
        available on iOS and Android, operated by an independent developer.
      </p>

      <h2>1. Purpose of the App</h2>
      <p>
        WeFitNest is a fitness and nutrition logging application designed to help users track workouts,
        log meals, and manage personal fitness goals. The App is intended for
        <strong>general wellness and lifestyle purposes only</strong>.
      </p>
      <p>The App does <strong>not</strong> provide medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment.</p>

      <h2>2. Health &amp; Safety Disclaimer</h2>
      <p>
        Before beginning any exercise, nutrition, or fitness program, you should consult a qualified healthcare professional.
      </p>
      <p>By using the App, you acknowledge and agree that:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>You are responsible for your own health decisions</li>
        <li>The App's workout suggestions, difficulty scores, and nutrition logs are <strong>not medical recommendations</strong></li>
        <li>The App does not replace professional medical advice</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        If you experience dizziness, pain, or discomfort, stop using the App immediately and seek medical attention.
      </p>

      <h2>3. User Responsibilities</h2>
      <p>You agree to use the App only for lawful purposes and in a manner consistent with these Terms.</p>
      <p>You agree <strong>not</strong> to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Misuse the App or attempt to reverse engineer it</li>
        <li>Upload harmful or inappropriate content</li>
        <li>Use the App in a way that could cause harm to yourself or others</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>4. User-Generated Content (Future Feature)</h2>
      <p>
        In future versions, the App may allow users to upload or share content (e.g., posts, photos, comments).
      </p>
      <p>If and when this feature becomes available:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>You retain ownership of your content</li>
        <li>You grant us a non-exclusive license to display it within the App</li>
        <li>You agree not to upload harmful, illegal, or offensive content</li>
        <li>We reserve the right to remove content that violates these Terms</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Currently, the App does <strong>not</strong> upload or share any user content externally.</p>

      <h2>5. Data Storage &amp; Privacy</h2>
      <p>At this time:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>All data (profile, photos, workouts, nutrition logs, barcode key) is stored <strong>locally on your device</strong></li>
        <li>No data is transmitted to external servers</li>
        <li>We do not collect analytics, identifiers, or personal information</li>
      </ul>
      <p>If cloud features are added in the future:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>You will be notified</li>
        <li>You will be asked for consent</li>
        <li>The Privacy Policy will be updated</li>
      </ul>
      <p>For more details, please review our <a class="policy-link" href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

      <h2>6. Camera Usage</h2>
      <p>The App uses your device's camera for:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Updating your profile photo</li>
        <li>Scanning barcodes to generate a digital key</li>
        <li>Food barcode scanning for nutrition logging (planned future feature)</li>
      </ul>
      <p>The App does <strong>not</strong> store or transmit camera data outside your device.</p>

      <h2>7. Age Requirements</h2>
      <p>You must be <strong>13 years or older</strong> to use the App.</p>
      <p>If you are under 18, you must have permission from a parent or legal guardian.</p>
      <p>The App is not intended for children under 13.</p>

      <h2>8. Account &amp; Data Deletion</h2>
      <p>Since all data is stored locally:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>You may delete your data at any time by deleting the App</li>
        <li>You may use <strong>Profile → App Settings → Reset All Data</strong> to clear local data</li>
        <li>No external deletion request is required</li>
      </ul>
      <p>If cloud accounts are added in the future, deletion instructions will be provided.</p>

      <h2>9. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>To the fullest extent permitted by law:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>We are not liable for injuries, damages, or losses resulting from your use of the App</li>
        <li>You use the App at your own risk</li>
        <li>Fitness activities carry inherent risks, and you assume full responsibility for your participation</li>
      </ul>
      <p>WeFitNest is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind.</p>

      <h2>10. Modifications to the App or Terms</h2>
      <p>
        We may update the App or these Terms at any time.
        Changes will be posted within the App or on our website.
      </p>
      <p>Continued use of the App after changes means you accept the updated Terms.</p>

      <h2>11. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>If you have questions about these Terms, you may contact us at:</p>
      <a class="contact-email" href="mailto:support@wefitnest.com">support@wefitnest.com</a>

    </div>

    <footer>
      &copy; 2026 WeFitNest. All rights reserved. &nbsp;|&nbsp;
      <a class="policy-link" href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>
    </footer>

  </body>
</html>
